{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/944772-what-news-from-gencon","id":944772,"title":"What news from Gencon?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-06T03:36:47-07:00","id":944772,"title":"What news from Gencon?","content":"Anything shared from the panel on 'Whats Up With the Classic World of Darkness?' that (I think) took place yesterday?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2157-deejay","name":"deejay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T08:45:10-07:00","id":944871,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">W20</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Shattered Dreams&quot; got delayed by the new relationship with WWP as it was the first book to get the full involvement and approval process with both companies.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Changing Ways&quot; is in process still.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Tribebook Bunyip&quot; is in early development and they will have someone with knowledge on Aborigines and culture to make sure they're handled in a respectful way, culturally.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Silver Crown&quot; sequel is &quot;finished&quot; and was going to be submitted to Rich this weekend, but with Gen Con, Bill is taking a few days to tweak it before submission.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">W20 dice roller was delayed by CCP approval processes and other delays. Now with the new WWP, the project is back in process.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Art book for W20 and W20 Book of the Wyrm will be combined into one book, but still collecting files and info.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Eternal Howl&quot;, an anthology of stories written in the &quot;feel/style&quot; of different editions and incarnations of W:tA (some may feel like Revised Ed., others like 1st Ed., etc.) Still just an idea ATM.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Prince's Gambit&quot; style party card game for W:tA (like Mafia, or Werewolf party game.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">---------------</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">V20</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Endless Ages&quot; anthology, similar to &quot;Eternal Howl&quot;, with Sykes of book editions, CCG, video games, etc.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Prince's Gambit&quot; card party game for 8-12 players where everyone is a primogeniture trying to find the Sabbat infiltrator (like Mafia, or Werewolf party game.)</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Lore of the Bloodlines&quot; to be like Lore of the Clans, (but for Bloodlines, duh.) in production.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">--------------------</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">V20 Dark Ages</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Tome of Secrets&quot; will have more campaign info for V20<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />A</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Dark Ages Companion&quot; will have ST tools for the game.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">DA Jumpstart will include info for players and STs to start games with your feet already running.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">DA20 Fiction Anthology.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">--------------------</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">M20</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Book of Secrets&quot; in editing. 200,000 words ATM.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Character Pack </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Book of the Fallen</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Mage Cookbook not being created by Phil as he &quot;knows nothing about that sorta thing&quot; (writing a cookbook at least.)</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Mage Artbook still needs compiling of art/sketches and quotes.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Digital Web 3.0 in the works</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Technocracy Reloaded&quot; (produced &quot;later&quot;)</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Rich Bastard's Guide to Magic&quot; will be rules of magic &quot;for the 1%.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">&quot;Victorian Mage&quot; still mostly just a concept, but some work has been done on it. [edited]</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">M20 Tarot a possibility now that DTCards can do tarot card sizes. </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">--------------------</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Wraith 20th</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Sections of the book for Orpheus, Specters, etc. each larger than their original supplemental books.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Also, revamping the Arcanos system.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">--------------------</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">C20</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">In editing and Art direction.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">C20 &quot;Immortal Eyes&quot; sequel 20 years later novel in talks with original writer.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> All credit goes to Arthur Dreese from Facebook. He's a good man. </span></span></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T10:00:01-07:00","id":944919,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the update! It looks like the new brochure is available on DriveThru now too!<br /> <br /> I was hoping they would say something about if there are any plans for any of the remaining game lines. I'd love to see Hunter and Demon revisited. There also doesn't seem to be any word about the ghost hunters book. That was one I was really looking forward to. But, what's on the schedule now is pretty exciting!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T11:10:09-07:00","id":944951,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/944772-what-news-from-gencon?p=944919#post944919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for the update! It looks like the new brochure is available on DriveThru now too!<br /> <br /> I was hoping they would say something about if there are any plans for any of the remaining game lines.<b> I'd love to see Hunter and Demon revisited</b>. There also doesn't seem to be any word about the ghost hunters book. That was one I was really looking forward to. But, what's on the schedule now is pretty exciting!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Me too. But I'm thinking next year's GenCon will have something for one--or both of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}